            <div style="width:28px;height:28px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e91e8c,#ff6bb3);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;flex-shrink:0;margin-right:8px;">🤱</div>
